OpenCourseWare website.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.340
And if you're an
educator who reuses

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.260
the materials in
your own teaching,

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.790
call or write to us
to share your story.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.860
You'll help inspire others.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.800
Thank you so much for listening.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.900
And if you like what
you've heard so far, please

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.570
consider leaving us a review
wherever you're listening

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.940
to this podcast today.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.730
Signing off from
Cambridge, Massachusetts,

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:53.970
I'm Sarah Hansen from
MIT OpenCourseWare.

